  "takes": [
    {
      "take": 1,
      "first": "Noll stopped sleeping on my floor after one night.",
      "last": "Noll had acquired a mattress from somewhere that had opinions about fleas but remained structurally committed to being a mattress.",
      "provider_context_id": "35c9d015a6824d84994906e2fca880bb",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/19efb086-1802-43d2-80a7-22747644ac8d.mp3",
      "provider_audio_url": "https://www.aidocmaker.com/g0/audio?name=35c9d015a6824d84994906e2fca880bb",
      "status": "artifact_captured",
      "durable_file": "greg-again/audio/assets/chunks/023-short/01.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 29.232,
      "sha256": "cc36dd30be0fa6ab12e3597837ef93eac46f582ebb9ce9c50a1b11a79d25cd51"
    },
    {
      "take": 2,
      "first": "I had given him my soap twice since the fire.",
      "last": "Of course she had.",
      "provider_context_id": "85b8ae70392b45eaa4c3b8a6a29e9143",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/b83829d6-7815-48f3-8e24-5515fb361ae4.mp3",
      "provider_audio_url": "https://www.aidocmaker.com/g0/audio?name=85b8ae70392b45eaa4c3b8a6a29e9143",
      "status": "artifact_captured",
      "durable_file": "greg-again/audio/assets/chunks/023-short/02.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 22.68,
      "sha256": "1b63eddbb6355c728872a5e9e6eff1318fcfc36eb442ee94abcbab47895ba102"
    },
    {
      "take": 3,
      "first": "Carrow's Guild knew about structural emergencies, monster sightings, unpaid hazard slips, marriages that affected contract names, and at least three kinds of public embarrassment before breakfast.",
      "last": "I would do it again.",
      "provider_context_id": "75bed05ea8804f1ba0ac490e24185169",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/78ba4846-b961-4ebb-96b7-594d699083a0.mp3",
      "provider_audio_url": "https://www.aidocmaker.com/g0/audio?name=75bed05ea8804f1ba0ac490e24185169",
      "status": "artifact_captured",
      "durable_file": "greg-again/audio/assets/chunks/023-short/03.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 24.312,
      "sha256": "8eb22e368ac63f5b04d58c58959d12e481d519806bd091ae66aecf0b128b9cef"
    },
    {
      "take": 4,
      "first": "That was different from wanting to spend the next several weeks waiting in Carrow for someone named Kesra Dain to arrive and tell nineteen-year-old me how badly I performed the first five inches of a discipline fifty-nine-year-old me had once mastered.",
      "last": "Weeks were a lot of life if you stopped treating them like a hallway.",
      "provider_context_id": "7f8b48a86d4146cc93b947f4cb4ac09b",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/48fda732-e479-4622-8264-b9050b8be4a8.mp3",
      "provider_audio_url": "https://www.aidocmaker.com/g0/audio?name=7f8b48a86d4146cc93b947f4cb4ac09b",
      "status": "artifact_captured",
      "durable_file": "greg-again/audio/assets/chunks/023-short/04.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 22.608,
      "sha256": "0062c6ed6df91314f569a759b8e15ef77642ae9c0f42bfadaef2bdb7b60f63e0"
    },
    {
      "take": 5,
      "first": "I looked at the board behind Sella.",
      "last": "One had three copper marks beside the Guild stamp and a road-office seal below it.",
      "provider_context_id": "9f2ef4100b7f41d79eb90994a4bc2e2c",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/678783c1-65d9-4a38-9963-71ca77d5d776.mp3",
      "provider_audio_url": "https://www.aidocmaker.com/g0/audio?name=9f2ef4100b7f41d79eb90994a4bc2e2c",
      "status": "artifact_captured",
      "durable_file": "greg-again/audio/assets/chunks/023-short/05.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 22.608,
      "sha256": "6d102b53fc8a589ae74d4fcace7e4a8865832734e530f3164d3368cafe2d44c3"
    },
    {
      "take": 6,
      "first": "WEST CUT ROUTE VERIFICATION. FOUR DAYS MINIMUM. LIGHT ESCORT. SURVEY PRIORITY.",
      "last": "Quarry road originally. Limestone and timber came through it before the western freight road was widened.",
      "provider_context_id": "71a0fe1e93ef46809199020b3f5fea01",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/d8914a0a-4acb-4813-8e53-a76a91d9971a.mp3",
      "provider_audio_url": "https://www.aidocmaker.com/g0/audio?name=71a0fe1e93ef46809199020b3f5fea01",
      "status": "artifact_captured",
      "durable_file": "greg-again/audio/assets/chunks/023-short/06.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 22.704,
      "sha256": "27d98e45d6f6bd25b0e022fa219df54409735638de1c0a7a176a210015691c3a"
    },
    {
      "take": 7,
      "first": "Later, when I knew Carrow as a place I returned to instead of a place I lived, the Cut was mostly foot traffic, goats, and people trying to avoid tolls.",
      "last": "Useful distinction.",
      "provider_context_id": "12bfda61468d424f81ce647a22281de2",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/2b40fad6-4a55-4bb5-82b5-21e0ad4bf53b.mp3",
      "provider_audio_url": "https://www.aidocmaker.com/g0/audio?name=12bfda61468d424f81ce647a22281de2",
      "status": "artifact_captured",
      "durable_file": "greg-again/audio/assets/chunks/023-short/07.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 24.072,
      "sha256": "5916d8a52d9080def79d67ea9f05a045d5facabfdb619234d1355348a27b2e2b"
    },
    {
      "take": 8,
      "first": "Why now?",
      "last": "Apparently someone in the road office had finally become curious whether an old quarry cut could carry couriers and pack strings without requiring three signatures and a prayer.",
      "provider_context_id": "b962ce3953dd49cfaea89cc47d1bc8c0",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/a27fcc08-4005-4986-a843-576c8a4d7bc9.mp3",
      "provider_audio_url": "https://www.aidocmaker.com/g0/audio?name=b962ce3953dd49cfaea89cc47d1bc8c0",
      "status": "artifact_captured",
      "durable_file": "greg-again/audio/assets/chunks/023-short/08.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 24.792,
      "sha256": "070af9d6ac969aa1011d46f0796fb738eb12eefe97f679a4e8ebaae57956f3fd"
    },
    {
      "take": 9,
      "first": "Who's surveying?",
      "last": "She had known when to stop chasing a hooktail after the problem stopped being ours.",
      "provider_context_id": "bb48fb84cc7b45b09b3a996bb03ce439",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/48c57c97-9b9b-4372-86ea-71bce0611e80.mp3",
      "provider_audio_url": "https://www.aidocmaker.com/g0/audio?name=bb48fb84cc7b45b09b3a996bb03ce439",
      "status": "artifact_captured",
      "durable_file": "greg-again/audio/assets/chunks/023-short/09.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 23.28,
      "sha256": "3ede5436c851745bce7956184c019b3aa10e248c288908e6cb5cb6d135c3f230"
    },
    {
      "take": 10,
      "first": "Useful person to follow onto an old road.",
      "last": "At nineteen the word had meant monsters, ruins, money, and a reasonable chance of returning with something sharp embedded somewhere inconvenient.",
      "provider_context_id": "baeb08c8402445e6bcfdc592f0303086",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/2c318265-75d6-42e6-814a-90c77e0d13d5.mp3",
      "provider_audio_url": "https://www.aidocmaker.com/g0/audio?name=baeb08c8402445e6bcfdc592f0303086",
      "status": "artifact_captured",
      "durable_file": "greg-again/audio/assets/chunks/023-short/10.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 26.64,
      "sha256": "7bee0876624544b0a16df5efd42a9fb0452fc188b7677f4ab92e22bd93cb00c5"
    },
    {
      "take": 11,
      "first": "At fifty-nine it had included a lot more mud.",
      "last": "That was a strange kind of permission.",
      "provider_context_id": "08b018e047674ddf87e86447df7e6698",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/3af967a6-7a03-4c4b-a62d-5dddb37f54f6.mp3",
      "provider_audio_url": "https://www.aidocmaker.com/g0/audio?name=08b018e047674ddf87e86447df7e6698",
      "status": "artifact_captured",
      "durable_file": "greg-again/audio/assets/chunks/023-short/11.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 25.296,
      "sha256": "a4ec07a3101277083924cfa7b59ae5efd61091e9843bc611157b7346d2029165"
    },
    {
      "take": 12,
      "first": "I'll take it.",
      "last": "I hated competent administration.",
      "provider_context_id": "1e0500e856be43c0a8b54b768cf97164",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/e12728dc-0ad1-4bf1-b4b8-b26605027a22.mp3",
      "provider_audio_url": "https://www.aidocmaker.com/g0/audio?name=1e0500e856be43c0a8b54b768cf97164",
      "status": "artifact_captured",
      "durable_file": "greg-again/audio/assets/chunks/023-short/12.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 19.296,
      "sha256": "e02e2128f41f6c51d08a49deeb509ee0b5f2ebdb0acc4fba89dda3244f9d16e6"
    },
    {
      "take": 13,
      "first": "Preparation cost three copper and most of the afternoon.",
      "last": "My boot seams needed wax.",
      "provider_context_id": "b7cedbb8cb4e427aae1688395be2c08e",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/7e604ebd-eebd-4dd8-bf6b-d074038f6593.mp3",
      "provider_audio_url": "https://www.aidocmaker.com/g0/audio?name=b7cedbb8cb4e427aae1688395be2c08e",
      "status": "artifact_captured",
      "durable_file": "greg-again/audio/assets/chunks/023-short/13.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 24.984,
      "sha256": "40317051a09b329e0ca6e27f61ace35a6a19763c6e46e5abfe9a54f0ea4c5cef"
    },
    {
      "take": 14,
      "first": "One sock had a hole at the heel.",
      "last": "Then I stood in front of a wool merchant for longer than I wanted to admit because a second pair of socks cost enough to become a philosophical question.",
      "provider_context_id": "d6bd3f40614641e28e5175b3b0bdad5d",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/0663a610-e864-4590-8b3e-84134ff151e6.mp3",
      "provider_audio_url": "https://www.aidocmaker.com/g0/audio?name=d6bd3f40614641e28e5175b3b0bdad5d",
      "status": "artifact_captured",
      "durable_file": "greg-again/audio/assets/chunks/023-short/14.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 28.2,
      "sha256": "a63e76a111623db13d5cf94e62616268139fb3e38124af676bfbc88ff5697005"
    },
    {
      "take": 15,
      "first": "I bought the socks.",
      "last": "He was sewing the rest badly.",
      "provider_context_id": "9e54e268a2c443ee9d089dbfe9a33d80",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/be9e4137-c0cf-4527-9d4d-a10edc4db874.mp3",
      "provider_audio_url": "https://www.aidocmaker.com/g0/audio?name=9e54e268a2c443ee9d089dbfe9a33d80",
      "status": "artifact_captured",
      "durable_file": "greg-again/audio/assets/chunks/023-short/15.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 23.856,
      "sha256": "f119da614f946e9de3a0b9fe2dcdf5306ccaa5395977e4a9434c765689e7b9ba"
    },
    {
      "take": 16,
      "first": "Leaving?",
      "last": "That made him look up.",
      "provider_context_id": "fad8f3bdadb44ac6b4a3712db3968b8d",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/89aa09b4-1260-4b95-9d3f-eeb86c85e8a8.mp3",
      "provider_audio_url": "https://www.aidocmaker.com/g0/audio?name=fad8f3bdadb44ac6b4a3712db3968b8d",
