    },
    {
      "take": 34,
      "first": "Harl looked at me.",
      "last": "Then another.",
      "provider_context_id": "b9c78d9a0c5a47629a5715ab6c1d4c38",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/ce02bea6-c157-4e7d-954a-80c65a50a359.mp3",
      "provider_audio_url": "https://www.aidocmaker.com/g0/audio?name=b9c78d9a0c5a47629a5715ab6c1d4c38",
      "status": "artifact_captured",
      "durable_file": "greg-again/audio/assets/chunks/023-short/34.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 18.84,
      "sha256": "2163d5ea7ce3c99264f4ff81522830c0c86b3523aa5f5eac59c1300d77c34099"
    },
    {
      "take": 35,
      "first": "The current pressed against him and his head came up.",
      "last": "I did not try.",
      "provider_context_id": "6076c5639fbc4d30a4a843484abd9269",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/9174f8ff-b05d-402b-be54-5e7cfb325995.mp3",
      "provider_audio_url": "https://www.aidocmaker.com/g0/audio?name=6076c5639fbc4d30a4a843484abd9269",
      "status": "artifact_captured",
      "durable_file": "greg-again/audio/assets/chunks/023-short/35.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 19.536,
      "sha256": "827d0d1ee10f54d8766dc1e10179ba425fb9cb35022f1b7ce814a42b4f300229"
    },
    {
      "take": 36,
      "first": "I moved downstream with him instead, kept the rope from wrapping my wrist, and pulled his head toward the shallow line.",
      "last": "Then all four.",
      "provider_context_id": "ee2edb7c4baa4d358c69f0738a3f41bf",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/6cb3c1db-4773-4c90-a0a9-6ed9bcad7cb0.mp3",
      "provider_audio_url": "https://www.aidocmaker.com/g0/audio?name=ee2edb7c4baa4d358c69f0738a3f41bf",
      "status": "artifact_captured",
      "durable_file": "greg-again/audio/assets/chunks/023-short/36.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 20.688,
      "sha256": "b4f9e765c41912115c88c39c59ce7726a7ce76a76391490a7c25a55a078c55ee"
    },
    {
      "take": 37,
      "first": "He climbed the far bank with the wounded dignity of a man who intended to rewrite the story later.",
      "last": "Good, he said.",
      "provider_context_id": "91cdc50d0cf54b4fa3f6dd562c77611d",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/77297505-7209-4373-9d7f-1ab557256bdf.mp3",
      "provider_audio_url": "https://www.aidocmaker.com/g0/audio?name=91cdc50d0cf54b4fa3f6dd562c77611d",
      "status": "artifact_captured",
      "durable_file": "greg-again/audio/assets/chunks/023-short/37.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 18.96,
      "sha256": "52112192f713c0b2da2e38f23abd89f7902307f9ce0c5fa8f351cd724ab4a37e"
    },
    {
      "take": 38,
      "first": "Edda stared at him.",
      "last": "The West Cut climbed away from the stream and narrowed between limestone banks.",
      "provider_context_id": "8bc6c854a23240ce892f2b66fbe13c3d",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/49642bc0-b206-41d3-9901-40c0f44e1b6b.mp3",
      "provider_audio_url": "https://www.aidocmaker.com/g0/audio?name=8bc6c854a23240ce892f2b66fbe13c3d",
      "status": "artifact_captured",
      "durable_file": "greg-again/audio/assets/chunks/023-short/38.mp3",
      "duration_seconds": 18.936,
      "sha256": "dd42369fdee74b1314d23c7a83d187e1d1974f388db65a1b8e86cea8bf1e2860"
    },
    {
      "take": 39,
      "first": "The city disappeared behind the slope.",
      "last": "I had chosen the contract because I wanted the days.",
      "provider_context_id": "212742af5e7d495a8725a20cb9826235",
      "preview_url": "https://storage.googleapis.com/adm--audio-playback--7d--public/mcp-preview/a9ca4419-0aab-48c9-b5d4-914611425161.mp3",
